# Cueva Secreta, floor 3 (C9, contract 56), 30 x 24, a cave (post-game). The ladder from floor 2 arrives in the SW corner (ladder (4,18), spawn from_2). A LAKE (rows 6..16) lies between the south shore and the
# island at the north end (10..19, 2..5) where ARKEGEN waits (the legend, L70, `legend=arkegen`): the island is reached only by Surf (`@surf yes`; water table below). The lab console beside it (11,3) tells what the Vertice
# experiment was (the diaries' payoff). Wild L58 - 64 on the shores, L56 - 67 in the water.
@map cueva_secreta_3
@size 30 24
@interior no
@cave yes
@surf yes
@area cueva_secreta
@bg 0
@fill crysg
@spawn from_2 5 19 E
@flag arkegen_gone 913                    # Arkegen was beaten or caught (the legend NPC's hide flag; Run keeps it)
@encounters grass rate=12
  tuskumo 58 64 10
  cragodile 58 62 10
  anklord 58 62 10
  somnarch 58 64 10
  gloomshroud 60 64 10
  razorfly 58 62 10
  glacielle 58 62 5
  reefdragon 60 64 5
  stormgill 58 62 5
  pyromeer 60 64 10
  gnucharge 58 62 10
  mesmaris 58 64 10
  lambalm 56 60 5
  voltgecko 58 64 5
  foldling 58 62 5
@end
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 2 creatures of this table wander the whole walkable floor (grass included); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 2 table=grass area=,. period=1800
@encounters water rate=15
  glacielle 58 64 10
  sagatee 56 62 25
  smashrimp 56 62 20
  urchlord 56 62 20
  stormgill 58 64 10
  reefdragon 62 67 5
  gleamjell 56 62 10
@end
@legend
  .  tile=crysg
  ,  tile=crys_0
  W  tile=none object=swall
  r  tile=none object=mrubble
  _  tile=none
  c  tile=crysg object=gcry
  a  tile=crysg object=stalag_s
  n  tile=crys_0
  L  tile=crys_0 door=rope_ladder
  U  tile=crys_0 door=rope_ladder
  i  item=ultra_cristal
  j  item=prime_salve
  k  item=vit_hp
  l  item=vit_atk
  m  item=vit_def
  o  item=vit_spd
  p  item=vit_spc
  ~  tile=sea_o
  C  tile=crys_0 object=console interact=look script=console
  Z  tile=crys_0 legend=arkegen level=70 npc=arkegen_ow face=SW hide_flag=arkegen_gone
  b  tile=crysg item=growth_seed
  d  tile=crysg item=vigor_flask
  e  tile=crysg item=savia_max
  H  tile=crysg hidden=trozo_oro   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  ______________________________
  _________WWWWWWWWWWW__________
  _________W..p....H..r_________
  _________W.C..Z...c.r_________
  _________W.c..,.....r_________
  ______WWWW........a.WWW_______
  ______W...~~~~~~~~~~b.dr______
  ______W~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~r______
  ______W~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~r______
  ______W~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~r______
  ______W~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~r______
  __WWWWW~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WWWW___
  __W.i..~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~...jr__
  __W.c..~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~...cr__
  __W..e.~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~....r__
  __W...a~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~a...r__
  __W....~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~....r__
  __W........................r__
  __W.L,.....................r__
  __W.,,.....................r__
  __W........................r__
  __W......k....a..........c.r__
  ___rrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr___
  ______________________________
@warp L -> cueva_secreta_2 spawn=from_3
# The lab console beside Arkegen's island: Vertice's notes (the payoff of the diaries found along the way: Genesa, the copy, the creature that obeyed no one).
@script console interact
    say cs.console.a
    say cs.console.b
@end
